      {
        "id": 138013,
        "name": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "username": "BlueHairedMeerkat",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/bluehairedmeerkat/{size}/1967_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-27T00:51:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Deadline is a Hufflepuff, I think. He does what he thinks is right, not in a heroic way (though you could make an argument for Gryffindor), but in a 'this has to be done' kind of way.</p><p>Lagacy is Gryffindor/Hufflepuff, so so is Iron Legacy.</p><p>Kaargra? Gryffindor, I think, the big show-off.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
