        "created_at": "2015-03-27T01:56:47.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>When trying to define Hufflepuff</p><p>\"Loyalty\" aims towards the right stuff</p><p>Knowing what Deadline's for</p><p>I'd put him in Gryffindor</p><p>But it's true that deciding is tough.</p>",
