      {
        "id": 138015,
        "name": "Nielzabub",
        "username": "Nielzabub",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nielzabub/{size}/1986_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-27T06:11:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I'll go ahead and do Prime Wardens</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Argent Adept - Ravenclaw. He's not ambitious enough to be a Slytherin, and not huggable enough to be a Hufflepuff, and not really main charactery enough to be in Gryffindor.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Haka - Hufflepuff. As a kindergarten teacher, Haka is very huggable.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Captain Cosmic - Gryffindor. He's already wearing the house colors so might as well.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Fanatic - Gryffindor. Fanatic is motivated by courage and faith rather than her own ambition.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Tempest - Gryffindor. Tempest is not calm and collected enough to be in either Ravenclaw or Hufflepuff. Since his primary motivation is to fight for the freedom of sentient species, that falls more in line with Gryffindor, but I could maybe see some arguments for Slytherin.</p>",
