      {
        "id": 138016,
        "name": "flyingscotsman2011",
        "username": "flyingscotsman2011",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/flyingscotsman2011/{size}/2476_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-04-02T01:06:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would think Expat is in Gryffindor. Yes, she has a sharp mind and enjoys tinkering with her guns which would make her an alright fit in Ravenclaw, but her play style is less that of a tactical thinker and more of a tank. She is a trained fighter, and she hates backing down from a fight, even if (and she almost seems to enjoy it when) she's the underdog in a fight. She shows that same bravery that we see from Harry, Ron, and even Neville Longbottom in the series, and I think that that bravery is what puts her in Gryffindor. Also, she could put a bullet between Voldemort's eyes before you could say \"Gillie Weed.\" And that mental image makes me very happy :)</p><p>\"Avada Ke-\"</p><p>BANG!</p><p>*roll credits*</p>",
        "post_number": 29,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T04:14:29.165Z",
